{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41636","headline":"将归锺陵留赠南海李尚书 · 陈陶","name":"将归锺陵留赠南海李尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚国有田舍，炎州长梦归。\n怀恩似秋燕，屡遶玉堂飞。\n越酒岂不甘，海鱼宁无肥。\n山裘醉歌舞，事与初心违。\n晔晔文昌公，英灵世间稀。\n长江浩无际，龙蜃皆归依。\n贱子感一言，草茅发光辉。\n从来鸡凫质，得假凤皇威。\n常欲讨玄珠，青云报巍巍。\n龙门竟多故，双泪别旍旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}